# label: alg:ch90-case
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch90.tex:124
# caption: Lower a typed list case without evaluating the unselected branch.

REQUIRE list scrutinee, empty branch, cons field binders and branch; equal result types
ENSURE selected branch with correctly bound fields
evaluate scrutinee to its required outer constructor
IF constructor is Nil THEN
  execute empty branch
ELSE
  bind head and tail fields in a fresh lexical environment
  execute cons branch under that environment
END IF

